          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "George Hendy and Will Butt press Borthwick's case with Champions Cup displays",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's view after round one of the Champions Cup is that Borthwick has a selection puzzle on his hands, with the wings the pressing issue. Northampton's George Hendy, who scored against Cardiff, and Exeter's Will Butt, who had Toulouse's backline on toast in France, both made telling cases, while Gloucester's Seb Atkinson and Arthur Clark also stood out. England may be looking for a winger to emerge given injury concerns in that department, and Hendy has done his prospects no harm."
