          "kicker": "Champions Cup",
          "heading": "Théo Attissogbe inspires Pau club to 41-17 Champions Cup win over Leicester",
          "body": "In a Champions Cup club match, Pau beat Leicester 41-17 at Stade du Hameau, with France star Théo Attissogbe central to the hosts' turnaround. Pau trailed 10-3 after 18 minutes and led only 17-10 at half-time, before outscoring Leicester 24-7 after the break. Planet Rugby's takeaways credit Attissogbe's 'moments of magic' for the change in momentum, and suggest Pau could be dark horses for the rest of the competition."
