          "heading": "Club: Avan Lee wants Peter O'Mahony's input as Munster seek permanent CEO",
          "body": "Munster's search for a permanent chief executive, a club matter rather than Ireland business, remains open after the province named New Zealander Avan Lee as interim. A fresh report says Lee wants input from legend Peter O'Mahony on the appointment. McMillan has said the CEO search will be no distraction for Munster. Lee's interim role means the permanent appointment is still to come."
