          "kicker": "Club debut",
          "heading": "Ex-Scotland captain Jamie Ritchie set for club debut with Glasgow against Benetton",
          "body": "Glasgow have set up the club debut of Jamie Ritchie, the former Scotland captain who signed from Perpignan over the summer, with assistant coach Nigel Carolan saying the time has come to \"unleash\" him. Ritchie has been sidelined by ankle and Achilles tendon problems and summer surgery, but is back in full training and expected to play against Benetton in Treviso, either starting or on the bench. The 30-year-old, capped 63 times, spent 11 years at Edinburgh before moving to Scotstoun on a two-year deal."
