          "kicker": "Coaching appointment",
          "heading": "Wales add match official Ben Whitehouse as full-time specialist coach under Tandy",
          "body": "Wales have added a match official to the national set-up, with the WRU confirming on Monday that Ben Whitehouse has joined Steve Tandy's men's squad full-time as a specialist coach. The 36-year-old is set to hang up his whistle after Saturday's URC clash between the Ospreys and Dragons in Swansea. According to the WRU, he will work with coaches and players on law, discipline, decision-making and communication, a role that echoes Jaco Peyper's laws adviser post with Rassie Erasmus' Springboks."
