          "body": "Shaun Edwards' move to Argentina now has a term attached: Sky Sports reports he has signed a contract running until after the 2027 Rugby World Cup, tying the defence coach to Los Pumas through the build-up to the tournament. Coverage says the deal rules out a role in Steve Borthwick's England set-up. Edwards has said Argentina were the first team to offer him a contract."
