          "heading": "Victor Matfield says Wallabies 'definitely not top four' before home World Cup",
          "body": "Springboks legend Victor Matfield says the Wallabies are not one of the world's best five sides and doubts they will reach the 2027 World Cup semi-finals. \"They're definitely not top four. I don't even think top five,\" he said. Australia are currently seventh in the rankings, having dropped below Scotland after back-to-back Bledisloe Cup defeats to the All Blacks. Sir John Kirwan, on the Rivals Rugby podcast, said: \"I just can't get a read on them.\""
