          "kicker": "Club news",
          "heading": "Club Shizuoka Blue Revs confirm Kwagga Smith contract termination by mutual agreement",
          "body": "The Shizuoka Blue Revs have parted ways with Springboks flanker Kwagga Smith by mutual agreement, the club confirmed on Tuesday, amid reports he is heading back to South Africa. The club captain in recent seasons played 81 matches for them and was named the league's Player of the Season in 2023. Rassie Erasmus has previously said Smith is unlikely to recover from a knee injury in time for the November Nations Championship."
        },
        {
